Task to do after:
To get the hang of the Keela contacts tab, add a contact that you think would be a good connection to have a part of Welfare Avenue & comment that company/person in the comments here (or add yourself).

You can also review the following:

- How to Manage your Contacts in Keela
- Tags, Custom Fields, Segments and Filters - Bringing It All Together
- Creating Segments

Managing Contacts on Keela

- [Contacts Overview](https://support.keela.co/hc/en-us/articles/360037346752-Contacts-Overview)
- [Manage a Contact Profile](https://support.keela.co/hc/en-us/articles/360037319931-Manage-a-Contact-Profile)
- [Subscription History](https://support.keela.co/hc/en-us/articles/4405487851149-Subscription-History)
